The **fake-fire-inspector** short is built, uploaded to R2, and captioned on the review worker. Nothing was posted to Instagram.

- **Film:** 71.7 s, 6 beats, 1080×1920. All six beats passed the build's transcript check against the script.
- **R2:** https://byclaude-video-review.pw3.workers.dev/m/short-fake-fire-inspector.mp4 returns 200, and its size matches the local file byte for byte.
